; AurumHydra - size 1, no goal mode, on FTMO's symbol names (the names AurumFunded uses; every one traded in the
; 2026-10-17 AurumFunded tester runs). For the leg on/off Strategy Tester run (job j5) and any other run on FTMO data.
; The source's defaults end in .pc / .r (another broker); without these lines the fix, stock-fall, Tokyo morning,
; after-holiday and noise legs find no symbol and stay out (job j4).
; Expected 2024-01 to 2026-10 from 10,000: research/hydra_tester_expect.py. Inputs not listed keep the EA's defaults.
InpGold=XAUUSD
InpYen=USDJPY
InpEuro=EURUSD
InpGridSymbol=AUDCAD
InpStocks=US500.cash
InpPound=GBPUSD
InpAussie=AUDUSD
InpLoonie=USDCAD
InpSwissy=USDCHF
InpFixCross1=AUDJPY
InpFixCross2=CADJPY
InpFixCross3=GBPJPY
InpMorn1=EURJPY
InpMorn2=GBPJPY
InpMorn3=CADJPY
InpNasdaq=US100.cash
InpSizeMult=1.0
InpGoalMult=0.0
; The Strategy Tester keeps the last run's value of every input a preset leaves out, so the inputs other Hydra presets
; or runs change are written here at the EA's defaults (j5's legs-off run inherited j4's 5x preset and legs: job j6).
InpGoalDays=21
InpGoalCap=20.0
InpGoalScale=1.0
InpGoalRepeat=true
InpMonthEndBoost=1.0
InpMaxDrawdownPct=35.0
InpBrakePct=0.0
InpBreakRiskPct=0.0
InpNoiseMult=0.0
